{
  "name": "ferry_landing",
  "version": 2,
  "introduced_by": "redrock",
  "notes": "The ferry landing at the end of the highway, 12 m wide and 23 m long: an asphalt apron raised 1.25 m on a concrete fill, with a 2 by 3 m toll booth on an island under a steel canopy and a boom across the lane, a slope up from the road at the back (local +Z) under a sign gantry, and a concrete ramp 10 m wide running 8 m down toward the lake at the front (local -Z) between timber fender piles. It carves nothing.",
